  "question": {
    "text": "At the foot of the mountain, the angle of elevation of its summit is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>,</mo></math> after ascending <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> towards the mountain up a slope of <math><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> inclination, the angle of elevation is found to be <math><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math>. The height (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>km</mi></math>) of the mountain is (take&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.7</mo></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1.35",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/7ce09c57-1cf6-4dd2-bb31-43c4f14b3918.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.54028in;height:1.65347in\" /></p><p>Let <math><mi>P</mi></math> be the summit of the mountain and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> be the foot.</p><p>Let <math><mi>A</mi></math> be the first position and <math><mi>B</mi></math> the second position of observation.</p><p><math><mi>B</mi><mi>N</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi></math> are <math><mo>&#8869;</mo></math>s from <math><mi>B</mi></math> to <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> and <math><mi>A</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> respectively.<br />Then,&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> ,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8736;</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br />Now, <math><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8736;</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi></math> is isosceles&nbsp;</p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi></math><br />But,&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> kilometre</p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> kilometre.<br />Now, <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>P</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mtext>m</mtext></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
